\c 1
\s A heading with a note\f + \fr 1:0 \ft A heading's note goes with the heading.\f*
\p
\v 1 In the beginning\f + \fr 1:1 \ft A footnote, with \fq a quotation\ft .\f* God\fe + \fr 1:1 \ft An endnote.\fe* created the heavens\x + \xo 1:1 \xt Test 1:2; Tst 1:3-4; See Job 9:8\x*.
\v 2 And the earth was formless. \f + \fr 1:2 \ft After a space.\f* The deep was dark.
\q1
\v 3 Light\f + \fr 1:3 \fp Two paragraphs,\fp and \+wh אוֹר\+wh* in Hebrew.\f* came.
\v 4 Day.
\c 2
